WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.975
That yellow one is you!

00:00:01.975 --> 00:00:03.252
And you've got a problem.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.168
The same report, again and again.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:08.865
There's a better way!

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.894
Excel, you know cold.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:12.871
Evenings are yours.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.628
So you look for people nearby.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.299
They know what you don't!

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:22.124
A group of five!

00:00:22.124 --> 00:00:23.741
Small enough to really talk.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.154
You join, and the seats start to fill.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.188
With three or four, you can start early.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.749
The fifth arrives. It begins!

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:37.639
They teach you. You teach them!

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:39.784
Now you know how!

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.477
Kvintet finds the time when everyone is free!

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.058
No back and forth.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:48.786
Plan the meeting right in the group chat.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.481
Five of you, one table!

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:54.425
Problem solved. Finally!

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:57.715
And everyone here has something to teach!

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.210
Kvintet. Come find your five!

